/**
 * TASK: Complete the onLogin method of this login form.
 *
 * When the login button is clicked:
 *   - if BOTH the user field and the password field are non-empty,
 *     set the status label to "welcome <user>"
 *   - otherwise set the status label to "missing input"
 *
 * Example: user "maria", password "secret" -> status "welcome maria".
 * Read the password with pass.getPassword(), which returns a char[]
 * (wrap it in new String(...) to get its length or text).
 */
